    "url": "https://www.devx.com/web-development-zone/the-complete-guide-to-indexing-json-data-in-postgresql/",
    "title": "The Complete Guide to Indexing JSON Data in PostgreSQL",
    "snippet": "Indexing JSON in PostgreSQL is how you turn that tax into something predictable. In plain terms, you are teaching Postgres how to quickly answer common questions about your JSON documents, does this key exist, does this document contain this subdocument, what is the value at this path, without rereading and re-parsing every row.   Summarize",
    "published": null
